11
12 18-3-402. Duties generally.
13
14 (a) The county clerk shall:
15
16 (xxvi) Report all conveyances, within five (5)
17 miles of a designated critical infrastructure zone as
18 defined by W.S. 19-13-501(a)(i), to the director of the
19 office of homeland security and the division of criminal
20 investigation in accordance with W.S. 19-13-501 and
21 19-13-502.
